- Role: A set of permissions associated with users.
- Security Clearance: A classification (High, Medium, Low) that determines access.
- Request: An action affecting system objects, classified by the highest classification level of affected objects.
- Emergency Mode: A system state with altered request processing and access rules.
- Normal Mode: The standard operating state of the system.

